<title>USA: Rehabilicare in European distribution pact.</title>
<headline>Rehabilicare in European distribution pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRIGHTON, Minn. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rehabilicare Inc said Monday it signed a letter of intent allowing a German company to distribute its pain management and rehabilitation products throughout Europe.</p>
<p>The company said B. Braun of Melsungen, Germany, will be the exclusive distributor of its products in 17 European countries and a non-exclusive distributor in six others.</p>
<p>A definitive agreement is expected to be signed by March.</p>
<p>Rehabilicare makes electromedical pain management products. Its stock closed unchanged Monday at 4-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
